## 5. Expressions

### 5.1 Primary Expressions

```
primary          = identifier
                 | literal
                 | '(' expression ')'
                 | list_literal
                 | record_literal
                 | function_literal
                 | object_literal
```

### 5.2 Postfix Expressions

```
postfix          = primary

---

## 6. Function Literals

```
function_literal = 'to' [ '(' [ parameter { ',' parameter } ] ')' ]
                    { statement }
                    'end'
```

---

## 7. Object Literals

```
object_literal   = 'new' identifier '(' [ argument { ',' argument } ] ')'
```

